VieNeu-TTS v3 Nano integration:
    src/vieneu/v3nano.py, src/vieneu/_nano_audio.py,
    src/vieneu/assets/voices_v3_nano.json
    Adapted from pnnbao97/VieNeu-TTS (Apache-2.0), revision
    d8ca4f91b9abb6be82ad1d8b1fdf0841e4b4ed29.
    Local changes: offline cache reuse, separate atomic custom-voice storage,
    and audio helpers isolated for compatibility with this application.

Supertonic 3 integration:
    apps/supertonic_engine.py
    Text normalization, chunking and the ONNX inference loop are adapted from
    supertone-oss-archive/supertonic py/helper.py (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025
    Supertone Inc.). The Supertonic 3 model weights are not shipped; they are
    downloaded on request and licensed under OpenRAIL-M (see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md).

Kokoro multilingual model (optional, downloaded on demand - not included in the installer):
    Model weights and voices: hexgrad/Kokoro-82M (Apache-2.0), ONNX export
    onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX (Apache-2.0).
    When the user chooses this model, the application installs on the user's
    own machine, from PyPI, into a separate add-on environment: kokoro-onnx (MIT),
    phonemizer (GPL-3.0-or-later), espeakng-loader / espeak-ng (GPL-3.0),
    joblib (BSD-3-Clause), cloudpickle (BSD-3-Clause), attrs (MIT), dlinfo (MIT),
    typing-extensions (PSF-2.0) - exact versions with SHA-256 hashes, apps/kokoro_locks.py;
    for Japanese and Chinese: misaki (Apache-2.0), fugashi (MIT AND BSD-3-Clause),
    unidic-lite (MIT; UniDic dictionary BSD-3-Clause), jaconv (MIT),
    mojimoji (Apache-2.0), jieba (MIT), pypinyin (MIT), cn2an (MIT), proces (MIT),
    addict (MIT), ordered-set (MIT). None of these packages are distributed with
    CIT Voice Studio.
    The GPU variant runs the original PyTorch weights hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
    (kokoro-v1_0.pth, Apache-2.0, downloaded on demand) with model code copied
    from hexgrad/kokoro 0.9.4 (Apache-2.0) into apps/_kokoro_torch/, which
    carries that project's LICENSE; modifications are noted at the top of
    each file.
